## How to resume (read first)

1. `ls workspace/` and `head -40 workspace/STATE.md` — orient.
2. Read the **Log** section below, newest last: it says what was actually done.
3. Re-run the environment rebuild commands (next section) — the sandbox is empty.
4. Re-run the last verification command in the log to confirm where you stand.
5. Continue from **Next action**. Do not re-derive anything already recorded.

