## Sandbox quirks learned (append as you hit them)

- {{QUIRK}}
- Absolute paths inside bash heredocs can be mangled — `cd` first or pass via env var (PITFALLS B4).
- Files outside the workspace root do not persist (PITFALLS A3).
- A busy port makes a new dev server die silently while tests hit the old one (PITFALLS A1).

